Copy of the diploma (if obtained abroad, recognition for further studies is also required); final-
year students must submit the diploma copy after the admission interview;
Copy of the transcript of records for both BSc and MSc studies (or printed electronic version);
Copy of the English language certificate proving at least intermediate (B2) level complex
(previously type C) state-accredited proficiency; if taken abroad, it must be recognized by the
